https://discord.gg/aeeucfw\"\u003eDiscord\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003enow.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTournament Format:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003c/u\u003eThe group stage will consist of 2 groups of 5/6 teams. Each team will verse every other team in their assigned group. After the group stage, the top 3 teams from each group will move on to the single-elimination final stage, with the 1st seed in each group receiving a direct spot to the semi-finals.\u0026nbsp;\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe group stage\u0026nbsp;will take place on Saturday July 22nd and Saturday July 29th for Group A and B\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIf you have any questions, feel free to ask them below and we will do our best to answer them.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); fon