vetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIf you have any questions, feel free to ask them below and we will do our best to answer them.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRegards,\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eThe Official Team.\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1499306696,"title":"Accepted Teams \u0026 Tournament Format","replies":[{"id":375299,"author":"poofywoo","body":"Pls dont do this early or in bst. thanks ily have fun gl","body_tagged":"Pls dont do this early or in bst. thanks ily have fun gl","created_at":1499332977},{"id":375300,"author":"Riilo","body":"When is the challonge\u0026nbsp;going to become public?","body_tagged":"When is the challonge\u0026nbsp;going to become public?","created_at":1499333163},{"id":375302,"author":"PokerFace","body":"After we figure out the schedule of matches for every team, we will release the challonge. The schedule will be figured out once we collect the results of the survey in order to create a fair schedule for every team.","body_tagged":"After we figure out the schedule of matches for every team, we will release the challonge. The schedule will be figured out once we collect the results of the survey in order to create a fair schedule for every team.","created_at":1499334179,"reply_to":375300},{"id":375303,"author":"PokerFace","body":"We'll do our best to avoid the odd hours.","body_tagged":"We'll do our best to avoid the odd hours.","created_at":1499334213,"reply_to":375299},{"id":375304,"author":"DaFrozenBlaze","body":"nice","body_tagged":"nice","created_at":1499334392},{"id":375308,"author":"falz","body":"Hype!","body_tagged":"Hype!","created_at":149